# Reference photography — ~274MB of camera originals, kept locally as the source
# for the graded webp files under src/assets/images. Committing them would bloat
# the history permanently and could never be undone cleanly. The manifest that
# records how they are organised IS tracked.
references/images/*
!references/images/MANIFEST.md

